        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Fallout Shelter puts you in control of a state-of-the-art underground Vault from Vault-Tec. Build the perfect Vault, keep your Dwellers happy, and protect them from the dangers of the Wasteland.\n\nVault-Tec has provided the tools, but the rest is up to you. What are you waiting for? Get started building your Vault today for free.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Fallout Shelter te pone al mando de una bóveda subterránea de última generación, creada por Vault-Tec. Construye la bóveda perfecta, mantén felices a tus habitantes y protégelos de los peligros del Yermo.\n\nVault-Tec te ha proporcionado las herramientas, pero el resto depende de ti. ¿Qué esperas? Empieza a construir tu bóveda hoy mismo, gratis.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
